feov-record: invalid argument "pass" for "--as" flag: --as must be one of PASS|FAIL (got "pass") — "pass" differs from "PASS" only in case, and a PASS is checked against the open board by exact match, so any other spelling skips the check entirely and records an unadjudicated pass

    PASS  every gap on the board is resolved — this is CHECKED against the open board, not taken on your word
    FAIL  at least one gap is still open, or you are not satisfied it was answered

the seat's terminal act: the PASS or FAIL, and the checkpoint that follows it

The seat's terminal act, and the checkpoint that follows it: the record is mirrored to the recovery copy.

A PASS is REFUSED while anything still blocks it — an open gap, an unruled motion, a line of inquiry unvoted this sitting. `show work` is the list; `sitting.complete` is true exactly when nothing blocking is left.

