feov-record: invalid argument "banana" for "--dimension" flag: --dimension must be one of severity|likelihood|impact|complexity (got "banana") — the ruling is matched to the filing on (gap, dimension) and the gap's grade is then read AT that dimension: an axis outside the four matches no ruling and reads no grade, so the motion is filed against nothing

    severity    how bad the defect is in itself
    likelihood  how likely the CONSEQUENCE is — never how likely the defect is to BE there, which is what one grade meant before v2 split them
